WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:02.767
Buying a home is already complicated.

00:02.867 --> 00:06.300
9 out of 10 homebuyers overpay for their mortgage.

00:06.267 --> 00:09.733
American homeowners overpay $3,343 on their mortgage, every year.

00:09.867 --> 00:13.300
Good rates exist. Lenders just aren't made to compete.

00:13.267 --> 00:17.867
Bankrate makes lenders compete for your loan. Until the best rate wins.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.167
You don't have to overpay.

00:22.200 --> 00:23.433
A consumer-first motion study inspired by Bankrate.
Concept, design and direction by Raj Shah
Independent exploration. Not affiliated with or commissioned by Bankrate.
